        {
          "_key": "k0015m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Many Bridgeton parents work in Vineland, at the hospital, in warehouses and food plants or in stores along Delsea Drive. Our center at 30 W Chestnut Ave is a 15 to 20-minute drive from Bridgeton, depending on where in Bridgeton you live. Many families take Route 56, which becomes Landis Avenue in Vineland, then head south on Delsea Drive to W Chestnut Ave. You can drop off on the way to work."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
